{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "be3e813b8b48deea43018d0adca6258dcad4f88a17c54e5c48299934232d52cb", "ja": "（今日の撮影は、無事終了。\nあとは麗花を家まで送り届けるだけだが……）", "zh": "（今天的拍摄顺利结束了。\n接下来只要送丽花回家就行了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "271a94f3c687279ae67038eb95f2fe9a81df6fe116f89244d295fcaa279f29ac", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした！\nパジャマに衣装に、今日の撮影は大忙しでしたね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n一下换睡衣、一下换表演服装，今天的拍摄好忙碌喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "617159d5329a9d29579c6bd4992d7a6c3260a97328975819e9635e5584c11c4a", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n遅くなったから、麗花も早く着替えて……。", "zh": "嗯嗯，对啊。\n时间不早了，丽花，你也快换掉服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "04953c9186af4201956e1c7baab36828e7b3d705355ca29893cac02b5b1441ca", "ja": "あっ、それなんですけど！\n……私、いいこと考えちゃいました！", "zh": "对了！关于接下来的行程！\n……我有个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "a399cf0779cc3a696227bf7f15ca23d53d01046dca36cb6c0e8474d8faad50e0", "ja": "今日は{$P$}さんのお家で、\nお泊まり会する、というのはどうでしょうか！", "zh": "今天就去{$P$}先生的家里过夜，\n你觉得如何呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7ab35ce7bf8dc01c3c4965fd128aad3cadc4b213fea4fded8c6014794e6edc90", "ja": "…………うん？", "zh": "…………什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "1f4739e16967c55870dd390e7fc4f18aa031f8e1de34d08044607666a2aae84a", "ja": "{$P$}さんのお家って、\nなんだか寝心地が良さそうだな～って思ったんです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生的家啊，\n感觉就很好睡～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "a18ed76293d8ac6e028132b680e3104c65c8ea91566a17923109e70ead17c44d", "ja": "それにそれに、{$P$}さんと\n一緒だと、とっても落ち着きますし！", "zh": "而且而且，和{$P$}先生待在一起，\n也非常令人放松！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "29486e3975a80af60d4551702b3c51e3c75889293112355a83ffe63b76e337cc", "ja": "いや、俺が落ち着かなくなる。……というか、\nちょっと待ってくれ麗花。うちに来るのはダメだぞ？", "zh": "不对，我可放松不下来……是说，\n你先别冲动，丽花。你不可以到我家过夜喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "35ee46c00bf0d0ced44e0c4e2a9dd7db886d4ddc552f8ca4b4b06e41ed58d068", "ja": "えーっ、どうしてですか？　{$P$}\nさんの部屋が散らかってても、私、気にしませんよ？", "zh": "咦～？为什么呢？{$P$}先生，\n就算你的房间很乱，我也不在意喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "05c600b2aa8e47f02c9cb9daf8051eec278cde221658ee0bbebf694e3cbef719", "ja": "何故なら、私の部屋も散らかっているからです！\nえっへん♪", "zh": "因为我自己的房间也是一团乱！\n哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e821aa4bbcd496db98ab45b40743df740bb357d4a34143817bf60ecb0247c69a", "ja": "いや、えっへんじゃなくてだな……。\n麗花はアイドルなんだから、さすがにまずいだろう？", "zh": "不是，你在得意什么啊……\n丽花，你是偶像，这样很不得体你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "0163969218a205268f3e9edf68787f542ab3747d5b00fa02d685fd4af83fdd05", "ja": "アイドルだから？\n……あっ、パジャマがないとかですか？", "zh": "因为我是偶像？\n……啊，要换上睡衣才行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "1dad14c16f73afe60025c40168f518e5c919215fb8411edcee451a2ecd4b7ecc", "ja": "それなら大丈夫です！\n今日の撮影で使ったパジャマ、借りていきますから！", "zh": "那就没问题了！\n我借今天拍摄用的睡衣过去换！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fe55172dba3bda44916230475d00ebea8d4d9de3e75ec2fe4970d17cbbe6217c", "ja": "そういう問題じゃなくて……とにかくダメだ。\nちゃんと送るから、家に帰るんだ。わかったな？", "zh": "不是那个问题……反正就是不行。\n我送你，你直接回家，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "900a5ea57b3f834bb3ba33b8c4d5d1b8a8a747ada1137d15352b876571ccc0a8", "ja": "え～、残念……。\nあ、じゃあじゃあ、今度みんなで、合宿をしましょう！", "zh": "咦～好可惜喔……\n啊，不然这样，下次大家一起集训吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "2d23c0d287c36cac1977d3a8067265695a3e4d2be5bbbe3f527d578d3709cc2d", "ja": "{$P$}さんのお家合宿！\n劇場のみんなも誘って……うん、きっと楽しいですよ♪", "zh": "在{$P$}先生家里集训！\n邀请剧场的其他人……嗯，一定很好玩♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "7ae260f472eed6e1bf35750a360c9bbfbf47d7ae7f5cff6b63af16e6bf7225e4", "ja": "さっそく、みんなに電話しちゃおーっと♪", "zh": "我赶快打电话告诉大家～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1018_p", "source_sha256": "07c34b1a80b8645f2382daaab76100a7164e8a5047bf54b28cd8ad0a96b53ce1", "ja": "ま、待て麗花！　うちは合宿ができるほど広くない……\nいや違う、そういう問題じゃなくてだな……！", "zh": "等、等一下，丽花！我家没空间可以集训……\n不对，不是那个问题……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0054_1019_p", "source_sha256": "caccf54f522ecd62bac0b290872e1e77611229a2c2cccea647ee00300d3afb34", "ja": "（無邪気というか、無防備というか……\nこの自由さも、麗花の魅力なんだけどな！）", "zh": "（该说她是天真无邪，还是毫无警觉呢……\n不过这么自由也是丽花的魅力啦！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
